==Strategy==
==='''Chapters 1 & 2'''===
Kill off the Helmut Krabbes with [[Valkyrie Cat (Special Cat)|Valkyrie Cat]] and [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Mythical Titan Cat]]. The use of [[:Category:Anti-Alien Cats|anti-Alien Cats]] is also recommended.

==='''Chapter 3'''===
While rushing this stage sounds like a good idea, it is infact not, and will make you lose instead because of the 500% Shibaliens. The main threats are Mistress Celeboodles and Scissoroos. They are very deadly to deal with, stacked 250% Scissoroos and stacked Mistress Celeboodles that one shots almost anything you deployed at 75% health. Abuse Mistress Celeboodle's single target flaw with bringing loads of cheap meatshields. Use good anti-Alien Cats like [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Castaway Cat]] and [[Psychocat (Rare Cat)|Neo Psychocat]] to freeze and slow these threats, then put a final blow on them with [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Cyborg Cats]].

